00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:56.320
should be the one to finish it she's done most&nbsp;
of the work anyway" and so it became the first of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:03.200
26 reports to include Katherine's name. If you&nbsp;
